---
title: "investorOnboarding (High Level Sale Customer Journey)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_discover: user discovers token sale
    q_discover --> q_kyc: begin KYC verification
    q_kyc --> q_check_kyc: submit KYC documents
    q_check_kyc --> q_address_verify: KYC approved
    q_check_kyc --> q_kyc_rejected: KYC rejected
    q_kyc_rejected --> [*]: revert NotEligible
    q_address_verify --> q_check_address: submit proof of address
    q_check_address --> q_eligible: address verified
    q_check_address --> q_addr_rejected: verification failed
    q_addr_rejected --> [*]: revert AddressVerificationFailed
    q_eligible --> q_review_terms: access deal terms
    q_review_terms --> q_set_reminder: sale not yet started
    q_review_terms --> q_ready: sale is active
    q_set_reminder --> q_ready: sale start time reached
    q_ready --> [*]: return eligibleInvestor

    note right of q_check_kyc
        INV-001: KYC and proof of address must both pass before any investment action
        INV-002: Eligibility gates are enforced before contract interaction
    end note
